OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786711712
OL,3,CNHS staff say plans to close hospital
OL,4,Cward will 'compromise patient safety'
OL,6,FSafety concerns have been raised by
OL,7,FNHS staff and patients' relatives over
OL,8,Fplans to close hospital beds for frail
OL,9,Fand older people in Kent.
OL,11,FMaidstone and Tunbridge Wells NHS
OL,12,FTrust is currently running a
OL,13,Fconsultation on the closure of 30 beds
OL,14,Fon Whatman Ward at Maidstone Hospital.
OL,16,FThe Trust says the move is part of
OL,17,Fservice changes linked to the NHS 10
OL,18,FYear Health Plan which aims to shift
OL,19,Fcare from hospital to community
OL,20,Fsettings.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
