CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786711712
OL,3,CNHS staff say plans to close hospital
OL,4,Cward will 'compromise patient safety'
OL,6,FBut staff, who wish to remain
OL,7,Fanonymous, say the ward closure will
OL,8,F"compromise patient safety in West
OL,9,FKent."
OL,11,FWhatman Ward is a geriatric medicine
OL,12,Fward which has 21 medical beds and
OL,13,Fnine additional assessment spaces.
OL,15,FIt's run by two geriatric consultants,
OL,16,Fspecialist frailty nurses and has a
OL,17,Fspecialist discharge team including
OL,18,Fphysiotherapists and occupational
OL,19,Ftherapists.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786711712
OL,3,CNHS staff say plans to close hospital
OL,4,Cward will 'compromise patient safety'
OL,6,FIt also has a dementia specialist key
OL,7,Fworker who helps to care for those
OL,8,Fpatients with particularly challenging
OL,9,Fbehaviour.
OL,11,FOne staff member said: "The reported
OL,12,Faim from the Trust is to ensure the
OL,13,FNHS 10 year plan is put in practice
OL,14,Fand to facilitate the transfer of
OL,15,Felderly patients into the community.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
