OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786711712
OL,3,CNHS staff say plans to close hospital
OL,4,Cward will 'compromise patient safety'
OL,6,F"Practically, with the reduction in
OL,7,Fcommunity rehabilitation beds, number
OL,8,Fof available nursing home beds and a
OL,9,Frecent reduction in Home Treatment
OL,10,FService (Community Frailty Team)
OL,11,Fhours, it is hard to see how this will
OL,12,Fnot significantly impact on older
OL,13,Fpatients' care who need admission to
OL,14,Fan acute hospital."
OL,16,FSome hospital staff believe that the
OL,17,Ftrust has provided less than six
OL,18,Fweeks' notice to patients, families,
OL,19,Fand stakeholders.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
