OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786711712
OL,3,CNHS staff say plans to close hospital
OL,4,Cward will 'compromise patient safety'
OL,6,FThey are asking the Health Overview
OL,7,Fand Scrutiny Committee to exercise its
OL,8,Fpowers to review the decision and halt
OL,9,Fthe end-of-August closure.
OL,11,FThey also want the NHS Kent and Medway
OL,12,FIntegrated Care Board to investigate
OL,13,Fthe alleged lack of public
OL,14,Fconsultation.
OL,16,FIn a statement, a spokesperson for
OL,17,FMaidstone and Tunbridge Wells NHS
OL,18,FTrust said: "We are reviewing how
OL,19,Fservices are delivered to ensure they
OL,20,Fremain safe, sustainable and able to
OL,21,Fmeet patients' needs in the future.
OL,26,@zD@MOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/6
