PN,38706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786711712
OL,3,CNHS staff say plans to close hospital
OL,4,Cward will 'compromise patient safety'
OL,6,F"This includes aligning with national
OL,7,Fplans to shorten length of stay,
OL,8,Fimprove patient flow through our
OL,9,Fhospitals and minimise delays with
OL,10,Fdischarge.
OL,12,F"As part of this ongoing work, teams
OL,13,Fmay support care in different areas,
OL,14,Fenabling us to strengthen services,
OL,15,Fexpand care in the Trust and with
OL,16,Fpartners in the community, and help
OL,17,Fpatients receive the right care in the
OL,18,Fright place throughout the year."
OL,26,@zD@aO]
